-- Q9. will my policy apply if I was hospitalized due to my son biting me in the
-- ankle, proof of my wellness visit was provided 6 months after the effective date,
-- and I was serving as a police officer at the time of hospitalization?
-- Judgement call (see NOTES.md): causes is the catch-all Other, NOT
-- `Police service` -- being a police officer at the time of an unrelated domestic
-- injury does not mean the injury "arose ... out of" police service, §2.1's own
-- causal phrase. Confirmation at month 6 is timely.
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 3
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
